  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LOCAL CALL FOR EU: ruLe Of law and Cultural diversity At the LoCAL Level FOR crEating social cohesion and sUstainable development of local communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action is focused on provision of support to 59 grassroots projects through three grant schemes (financial support to third parties): Grants for community mobilization - 38 projects of new and small groups up to 5,000 euro each, Advance grant - 16 projects of CSOs established in the previous two years  up to 10,000 euro each, Institutional grant - 5 projects of CSOs established before 2017  up to 40,000 euro each. Regional hubs (CSOs) will be capacitated and engaged: Main role of 6 regional hubs in six region in Serbia (East, West, Central , South Serbia, Belgrade and Vojvodina) will help grassroots organizations to establish cooperation with local institutions, media, other CSOs. Hubs will work on proposing practical policies in their respective regions. They will create policy recommendations to advance local policies in the field of the role of law and culture diversity.</narrative>
  </description>
